  # INSTRUCTION > activities/ACTIVITY > description/ITEM_TREE > items/CLUSTER > items/ELEMENT
  # In some jurisdictions, orders to dispense may have an expiry date after which the prescription may not be dispensed.
  ['term', 'at0161', 'comment'] => "国や地域によっては、調剤のオーダーに有効期限があり、期限を過ぎるとその処方箋に基づく調剤ができなくなる。",

  # INSTRUCTION > activities/ACTIVITY > description/ITEM_TREE > items/CLUSTER > items/CLUSTER > items/ELEMENT
