  # For example: 'Not responsive at maximum recommended dose. Critical situation.', 'Peniciilin is only valid treatment, likelihood of true penicillin allergy is low'.
  ['term', 'at0162', 'comment'] => "例：「推奨される最大用量でも反応がなく、危機的な状況である」「ペニシリンだけが有効な治療であり、真のペニシリンアレルギーである可能性は低い」。",

  # INSTRUCTION > activities/ACTIVITY > description/ITEM_TREE > items/CLUSTER > items/CLUSTER > items/ELEMENT
  # Purpose
  ['term', 'at0165', 'text'] => "目的",

  # INSTRUCTION > activities/ACTIVITY > description/ITEM_TREE > items/CLUSTER > items/CLUSTER > items/ELEMENT
  # Description of the reason for recording a total daily effective dose.
  ['term', 'at0165', 'description'] => "1 日実効総用量を記録する理由の説明。",

  # INSTRUCTION > activities/ACTIVITY > description/ITEM_TREE > items/CLUSTER > items/CLUSTER > items/ELEMENT
